  <item>
    <title>107-己亥月运｜年底如何少走弯路？下个月调整节奏，把力气花在值得的事上</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae8b5d297726cd4675bbc46</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae8b5d297726cd4675bbc46</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>天气一冷，你是不是也开始不想出门、不想社交，下班只想窝在家里？</span></p><p><span>前几个月还在向外冲，忙工作、找机会、安排各种计划，最近却突然想缓一缓。</span></p><p><span>这个时候，</span><strong><span>我们该怎么调整节奏？手里的机会还要不要接，已经付出的努力，又该怎样变成真正属于自己的积累？</span></strong></p><p><span>这期月运，用</span><strong><span>「沉潜、转化、蓄势」</span></strong><span>三个关键词，陪大家梳理接下来一个月的工作、关系、金钱和生活安排。</span></p><p><span>机会变多的时候，怎么判断哪些值得投入？</span></p><p><span>面对朋友、合作伙伴和人情往来，怎样避免因为不好意思拒绝而消耗自己？</span></p><p><span>当压力上来、行动慢下来，我们还能为下一步做些什么？</span></p><p><span>希望听完之后，你能更清楚地知道：</span><strong><span>接下来，自己的力气该往哪里放。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>🎧 收听指路</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> 为什么最近越来越想慢下来？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a> 从立冬到大雪，怎样把过去的成果转化成养分</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="244">04:04</a> 本月关键词：沉潜、转化、蓄势</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="278">04:38</a> 大环境的节奏变化：从重速度，到重策略</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> 入冬后的身体照顾与运动提醒</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="663">11:03</a> 属蛇、属猴：变动与沟通中，需要多留意什么？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="776">12:56</a> 本月风水方位分享</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="852">14:12</a> 十天干日主怎么听？先找到自己的属性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="891">14:51</a> </span><strong><span>甲木</span></strong><span>｜创意变现，稳扎稳打</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> </span><strong><span>乙木</span></strong><span>｜机会多多，谨慎选择</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1175">19:35</a> </span><strong><span>丙火</span></strong><span>｜锋芒毕露，留点余地</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1435">23:55</a> </span><strong><span>丁火</span></strong><span>｜享受生活，守住钱包</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1622">27:02</a> </span><strong><span>戊土</span></strong><span>｜整理资源，别着急冲</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">29:42</a> </span><strong><span>己土</span></strong><span>｜稳扎稳打，别乱投资</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1928">32:08</a> </span><strong><span>庚金</span></strong><span>｜压力转化，贵人相助</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2078">34:38</a> </span><strong><span>辛金</span></strong><span>｜沉淀专业，别想太多</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2244">37:24</a> </span><strong><span>壬水</span></strong><span>｜机会与压力并存，量力而行</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> </span><strong><span>癸水</span></strong><span>｜压力山大，守住界限</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">42:50</a> 四个日常行动：整理、保暖、动中求稳、睡前断网</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2734">45:34</a> 近期仪式安排与咨询信息</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2878">47:58</a> 下期见，评论区继续聊</span></p><p><strong><span>💬 评论区聊聊</span></strong></p><p><span>最近的你，是想继续往前冲，还是已经很想缓一缓了？</span></p><p><span>也欢迎留下你的日主，聊聊你的感受和问题。</span><strong><span>我们依旧会在评论区抽奖，等你来交流～</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsnDYyqL4DZ4Be2xV1d8jYt7erHf.png"><p><span>晴晴和la宝有一个自己的品牌</span><strong><span>〖又见〗</span></strong><span>，请联系la宝 </span><strong><span>lrnyxxx</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>🎵 BGM</span></strong></p><p><span>Devon Cole — I Got You</span></p>]]></description>
