  <item>
    <title>102-丁酉月运！为什么这个月 &quot;越假越露馅、越真越亮眼&quot;？八字 &quot;灯光筛&quot; 帮你筛人筛事～</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a969b33a0210c197dcbadd1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a969b33a0210c197dcbadd1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>进入丁酉月，天地能量正式</span><strong><span>从「动」切换到「收」</span></strong></p><p><span>如果说上个月丙申是「阳光照在刀剑上」——看你的能力够不够硬</span></p><p><span>那么这个月丁酉就是</span><strong><span>「灯光照在珠宝上」——看你的品质经不经得起细筛</span></strong><br><br><span>这个月你会发现：标准变高了、要求变细了、有些人突然懒得应付了</span></p><p><span>别慌，不是你在变差，也不是别人在针对你</span></p><p><span>是天地进入</span><strong><span>「酉月筛子」——假的关系藏不住，真的本事会更亮</span></strong><br><br><span>------------分割线-------------</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">00:01:06</a>: 本月的磁场大环境</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="571">00:09:31</a>: 命盘地支中有“戌 、卯”的 需要注意什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="663">00:11:03</a>: 本月的九宫飞星 要注意哪几个方位？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="769">00:12:49</a>: 甲木</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="934">00:15:34</a>: 乙木</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">00:17:50</a>: 丙火</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1211">00:20:11</a>: 丁火</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1368">00:22:48</a>: 戊土</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1545">00:25:45</a>: 己土</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1705">00:28:25</a>: 庚金</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1883">00:31:23</a>: 辛金</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2101">00:35:01</a>: 壬水</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2247">00:37:27</a>: 癸水</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2382">00:39:42</a>: 本月的一些小建议</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2679">00:44:39</a>: 关于抽奖和下期选题</span></p><p><span>-----------分割线------------</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft_vXj52GSaGrAuUJ-oiPvfx1E5y.jpg"></figure><p><span>晴晴和la宝有一个自己的品牌</span><strong><span>【又见】</span></strong></p><p><span>咨询、水晶、其他玄学宝藏小物~</span></p><p><span>感谢各位~有什么想听的内容或者想要讨论的记得多多评论，下期见啦！</span></p><p><span>本期BGM： I can't stop</span></p>]]></description>
