    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a550614ca0de6c44ae68f23</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 13 Jul 2026 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有没有发现，</span><strong><span>同样是丙午年，上半年和下半年的感觉完全不一样？</span></strong></p><p><span>上半年像打了鸡血——想法多、社交多、到处跑、很"散"但很有劲</span></p><p><span>最近这两个月，突然开始想把想法落地了</span></p><p><strong><span>从"想"变成"做"，</span></strong><span>但又有点急、有点燥、有点焦虑</span></p><p><span>这不是你累了，是</span><strong><span>这一年的"火"，换了烧法～</span></strong></p><p><span>如果你最近也觉得"该收网了""该落地了""该成形了"，但又有点摸不着方向，那就一起来听听我们这期节目吧。</span></p><p><span>------------分割线-------------</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">00:01:14</a>: 下半年的磁场大环境的变化及原因</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="783">00:13:03</a>: 甲木</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1041">00:17:21</a>: 乙木</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">00:21:19</a>: 丙火</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1517">00:25:17</a>: 丁火</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1798">00:29:58</a>: 戊土</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2049">00:34:09</a>: 己土</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2266">00:37:46</a>: 庚金</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2471">00:41:11</a>: 辛金</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2650">00:44:10</a>: 壬水</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2867">00:47:47</a>: 癸水</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3371">56:11</a>1: </span><strong><span>关于抽奖，下期节目的选题由你投票来定（评论区即可参与哦，评论你下半年想落地的事情+想下期听到的选题）</span></strong></p><p><span>-----------分割线------------</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft_vXj52GSaGrAuUJ-oiPvfx1E5y.jpg"></figure><p><span>晴晴和la宝有一个自己的品牌</span><strong><span>【又见】</span></strong></p><p><span>咨询、水晶、其他玄学宝藏小物~</span></p><p><span>感谢各位~有什么想听的内容或者想要讨论的记得多多评论，下期见啦！</span></p><p><span>本期BGM： Trees</span></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
