    <title>96-你不是性格差，是五行在作怪：情绪上头别硬忍，试试&quot;以情胜情&quot;急救术～</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a4d1a883fb7233cbf4555cf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a4d1a883fb7233cbf4555cf</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>最近是不是特别容易炸毛？莫名其妙就焦虑？</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>睡不好、想太多、突然低落？</span></strong></p><p><span>别着急自责自己"性格不好"</span></p><p><span>最近火旺，大环境本来就在放大所有人的情绪</span></p><p><span>但更重要的是——</span><strong><span>你的八字里，早就写好了你的"情绪体质"</span></strong></p><p><span>本期节目，我们带着</span><strong><span>五行情绪对照表</span></strong></p><p><span>一个一个帮你认清自己的"情绪体质"，然后给出</span><strong><span>情绪的解药</span></strong></p><p><span>-----------分割线------------</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">00:01:20</a>: 说在前面</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">00:04:55</a>: 五行和情绪的关系</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">00:06:45</a>: 五行相生相克去解决自己过度的情绪的底层原理</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="631">00:10:31</a>: 木型人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="899">00:14:59</a>: 火型人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1197">00:19:57</a>: 土型人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1452">00:24:12</a>: 金型人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1788">00:29:48</a>: 水型人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2129">00:35:29</a>: 通用三招：怎么样利用五行相生相克的原理去解决自己过度的情绪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2658">00:44:18</a>: </span><strong><span>下一期的选题，你们来投票，依然有抽奖哦，欢迎大家评论～</span></strong></p><p><span>-----------分割线------------</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft_vXj52GSaGrAuUJ-oiPvfx1E5y.jpg"></figure><p><span>晴晴和la宝有一个自己的</span><strong><span>品牌【又见】</span></strong></p><p><span>感谢各位~有什么想听的内容或者想要讨论的记得多多评论，下期见啦！</span></p><p><span>本期BGM：Future Love</span></p>]]></description>
